 value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 32 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 135% of normal in June to July and 61% in August to September. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids sat at 52% in January to February and climbed to 99% by June to July. Grid 22094 had its driest year in 1963 at 72% of normal.</p>"}
